<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: PFK small shelf -->
  <PFK_ShelfSmall.label>兒童房小置物架</PFK_ShelfSmall.label>
  <!-- EN: A toy chest-style locker to keep the clutter in check!\nIt holds three times as many items as placing them on the floor, prevents deterioration, and doesn't impact room beauty. Limited space means no large objects or materials can be stored.\n\nRotate to view different designs.\nFunctions the same as a standard small shelf. -->
  <PFK_ShelfSmall.description>一個玩具盒風格的三層置物架，可以比單放在空地收納多三倍的物品。架內的物品永不衰敗，也不會影響周圍的美觀。\n\n由於置物架空間有限，它不能收納塊堆、建築物、植物和大型屍體。\n\n屬性和功能同原版小物品架一致。可通過旋轉來改變此建築的貼圖。</PFK_ShelfSmall.description>
  
</LanguageData>